Package: claw-os-base
Version: __VERSION__
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Architecture: __ARCH__
Maintainer: Claw OS <noreply@github.com>
Homepage: https://github.com/xiaoyu-work/claw-os
Depends: bash, coreutils, ca-certificates
Recommends: nodejs (>= 24), python3, python3-pip, git, ripgrep, curl, jq, sqlite3
Description: Claw OS — agent-native operating system core
 Claw OS is a Debian-based Linux distribution designed for AI agents.
 This package installs the `cos` supervisor binary, the `clawd`
 system agent daemon, the recovery helper `cos-init`, the shared
 OverlayFS helper for the agent home, the per-user agent configuration
 under `~/.config/cos/`, and the bundled apps, skills, and Python helper packages
 (`claw_os_sdk`, `cos_runtime`) under `/usr/lib/cos/`.
 .
 On its own, this package provides a complete agent runtime usable
 from any shell. Install `claw-os-systemd` to add boot-time services,
 or `claw-os-browser` to add the cos-browser engine.
